<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sheffield Shield cricket standings</p>
<p>after results on Sunday (tabulate under played, won outright,</p>
<p>won on first innings, drawn, lost on first innings, lost</p>
<p>outright, points):</p>
<p> Western Australia  7   4   2   0   0   1   28</p>
<p> New South Wales    8   3   1   0   1   3   22</p>
<p> Queensland	   6   3   1   0   1   1   20</p>
<p> Victoria	     7   3   0   0   1   3   17.7</p>
<p> Tasmania	     6   1   1   0   1   3   12</p>
<p> South Australia    6   1   0   0   1   4    6</p>
<p>Note: Western Australia took first innings points before</p>
<p>match against Queensland was drawn, New South Wales took</p>
<p>first innings points before losing to Victoria and Tasmania took</p>
<p>first innings points before losing outright to Victoria and</p>
<p>Western Australia. Victoria deducted 0.3 points for slow over</p>
<p>rate against New South Wales.</p>
</text>
